2026-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0235","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0235.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-0235","title":"Palo Alto Networks Prisma Browser 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks Prisma Browser 存在条件竞争漏洞，本地经过身份验证的非管理员用户可利用此漏洞绕过浏览器的访问控制和数据策略限制，导致未授权访问敏感信息或规避安全策略。攻击者需要本地访问权限并以低权限用户身份操作，利用条件竞争窗口实施绕过。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-0235","HWPOC-2026-05f2e47b"],"sources":["cve","hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Prisma Browser 到 146.10.7.154 或更高版本，该版本在 PAN-SA-2026-0007 安全公告中发布，可从 Palo Alto Networks 官方支持门户获取。受影响版本为低于 146.10.7.154 的桌面版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2026-0235","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-0235"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0235.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0741","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0741.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34342","title":"Microsoft Windows Print Spooler 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 打印后台处理程序 (Print Spooler) 存在并发执行时共享资源未正确同步的竞态条件漏洞 (CWE-362)。本地已授权攻击者可通过精心构造的竞争条件操作触发该漏洞，在 Windows Print Spooler 组件中提升本地特权。该漏洞要求攻击者具有登录系统的本地访问权限，并依赖特定的竞争时机，因此攻击条件较高 (AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N)。成功利用后，攻击者可在系统层级获取完全控制权限，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性 (C:H/I:H/A:H)。CVSS 评分为 7.0，危害等级为高危 (HIGH)。此类漏洞常用于本地提权场景，建议及时安装 Microsoft 最新安全更新以修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34342"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-12T18:17:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:38:54Z","remediation":"立即安装 Windows 2024 年 10 月累积更新 (KB5043391)，或更新到 Windows 11 版本 23H2；更新到 Windows 10 版本 22H2 的 November 2024 更新 (KB5043382)，这两款更新包含针对 Print Spooler  race 条件漏洞的补丁。如果无法立即更新，可通过注册表禁用 Print Spooler 后台支持处理程序服务 (RpcSs)，路径为 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Spooler\\Parameters，新增 DWORD 键 \"DisableDriverDownload\" 值为 1，以阻止攻击者通过驱动加载利用 race 条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-34342","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c3b619fb02eed1c084cf7dca0b26d6106b797434/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9817bd0b2a0b37e152bc78d1e5d04dcda46be3df/content/posts/cve-2026-34342.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-343xx/CVE-2026-34342.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-34342","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2026-34342.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0741.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0558","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-33838","title":"Microsoft Windows 消息队列 (MSMQ) 双重释放特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 消息队列（MSMQ）组件中存在双重释放（Double Free）漏洞（CWE-415），已认证的攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的消息队列请求触发该漏洞，导致在内核上下文中实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows 消息队列服务，攻击者需具备本地低权限账户即可利用，无需用户交互。成功利用后攻击者可获取 SYSTEM 权限，完全控制受影响系统。Microsoft 尚未发布官方安全更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-33838"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-12T18:17:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:38:11Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 5 月安全更新，通过 Windows Update 自动获取或访问 https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33838 手动下载对应版本补丁。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2012/2016/2019，修复版本分别为 10.0.14393.9140（Win10 1607/Server 2016）、10.0.17763.8755（Win10 1809/Server 2019）、10.0.19044.7291（Win10 21H2）、10.0.19045.7417（Win10 22H2）、10.0.22631.7079（Win11 23H2）、10.0.26100.8457（Win11 24H2）、10.0.26200.8457（Win11 25H2）、10.0.28000.2113（Win11 26H1）。如无法立即打补丁，可在不影响业务的情况下禁用 MSMQ 服务（services.msc 中停止 Message Queuing 服务）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33838","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33838.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-33838.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-33838","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33838.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-33838.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-vvg8-qx8v-fp7m/GHSA-vvg8-qx8v-fp7m.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-33838","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-33838.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-05-13_11-35-22.md","https://github.com/ZentrixLabs/windows-version-feed/blob/af76870f960890767e1076ca2ffa35174b862532/cvrf_mapping_debug_20260517_024254.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0694","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0694.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-43983","title":"Pocket ID OIDC 刷新令牌流程权限绕过漏洞","description":"Pocket ID 的 `createTokenFromRefreshToken` 函数在处理 OIDC 刷新令牌流程时，仅验证了令牌的加密完整性，而未重新验证用户的当前授权状态。这导致攻击者在持有合法刷新令牌的情况下，可以通过刷新流程绕过三种限制：1. 授权撤销：用户撤销客户端授权后，刷新令牌依然有效；2. 账户禁用：管理员禁用用户账户后，刷新令牌仍能生成新的访问令牌；3. 组限制：用户被移出允许访问的组后，刷新令牌依然可用。攻击者只需向 `/api/oidc/token` 端点发送含有有效刷新令牌的请求，即可实现权限持久化并获取用户敏感信息，严重影响企业级账户管理的安全基线。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-43983","GHSA-w6p7-2fxx-4f44"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-05-12T15:16:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:50:09Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Pocket ID 升级至 v2.6.0 或更高版本。升级后，系统将在 OIDC 刷新令牌流程中重新验证用户账户是否被禁用、授权记录是否依然存在以及组权限是否匹配，从而防止失效令牌被持续利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pocket-id/pocket-id/security/advisories/GHSA-w6p7-2fxx-4f44","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2026/CVE-2026-43983.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/077172bcea3338bafb871871e211bbb7c87f3c3c/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-43983.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/be745c1ea7b9b91e65f3d64ef3f756698bb41557/data/2026/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-43983.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-43983.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0694.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0694.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0121","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-7256","title":"Zyxel WRE6505 Web 界面命令注入漏洞","description":"Zyxel WRE6505 v2 固件 V1.00(ABDV.3)C0 的 CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞（CWE-78），LAN 中相邻攻击者可通过向设备 Web 管理界面发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在目标设备上以 root 权限执行任意操作系统命令。该设备已停产（EOL），Zyxel 不再提供安全更新，建议用户更换设备；临时缓解措施包括在网络层限制管理界面的访问来源 IP，避免将管理端口暴露至公网。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-7256"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-12T04:16:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T11:02:05Z","remediation":"Zyxel WRE6505 v2 已停产（EOL），厂商不再发布安全补丁，建议立即更换为仍在支持周期内的 Zyxel 设备型号。在更换前，作为临时缓解措施：在路由器/防火墙上配置 ACL，仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问设备管理界面（默认 80/443 端口），禁止将管理端口暴露至公网；同时将设备置于独立 VLAN 中，限制与核心网络的通信。若无需远程管理，可关闭设备的 Web 管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zyxel.com/global/en/support/end-of-life","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/7xxx/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/7xxx/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-7256.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-7256.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/78453fda61545f56ec9c1e2f8e5aa78adf2aa3c6/app/routes/posts/2026-05-12_CVE-2026-7256.mdx","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Zyxel_WRE6505_Web_%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-7256.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/194ebc78855b60e2ccd7fdd9fdb5de6934de4ed3/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-7238.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/68f861ef7056d26a199514826964f9781eeba15e/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-c7j6-24cr-x2rf/GHSA-c7j6-24cr-x2rf.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-7256"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0549","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28955","title":"Apple WebKit 内存处理漏洞","description":"Apple WebKit 存在内存处理漏洞（CWE-119/CWE-120），由于对恶意构造的网页内容内存处理不当，导致缓冲区边界检查不充分。远程攻击者可诱导用户访问特制网页触发该漏洞，造成目标进程意外崩溃或内存破坏。该漏洞影响 Safari 26.5 之前版本、iOS 18.7.9/iPadOS 18.7.9 之前版本、macOS Tahoe 26.5 之前版本、tvOS 26.5、visionOS 26.5 及 watchOS 26.5 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。攻击者需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接），无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低。Apple 已在 2026 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28955"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-11T21:18:56Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:19:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Safari 升级至 26.5 版本，iOS/iPadOS 升级至 18.7.9 或 26.5，macOS Tahoe 升级至 26.5，tvOS/visionOS/watchOS 升级至 26.5。Linux 系统用户将 webkit2gtk3 升级至 2.52.4 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可配置 Web 内容过滤器或禁用 WebKit 渲染引擎作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/127110","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127111","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127115","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127118","https://support