2026-28955.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-28955.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0548","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28941","title":"Apple Model I/O 文件处理内存越界读取漏洞","description":"Apple Model I/O 框架在处理恶意构造的文件时存在内存访问越界漏洞（CWE-119）。由于对文件数据边界检查不足，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制文件触发越界读取或写入操作，导致应用程序崩溃拒绝服务，或泄露进程内存中的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 iOS 18.7.9/iPadOS 18.7.9、macOS Sequoia 15.7.7 及 macOS Tahoe 26.5 之前版本，攻击需用户交互（如打开恶意文件），CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。Apple 已在 2026 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28941"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-11T21:18:55Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:29:22Z","remediation":"立即将 iOS/iPadOS 升级至 18.7.9 或更高版本，macOS Sequoia 升级至 15.7.7 或更高版本，macOS Tahoe 升级至 26.5 或更高版本。可通过系统设置中的软件更新功能或 Apple 官方支持页面下载安装。临时缓解措施：避免在受影响系统上打开来源不明的文件，尤其是模型文件。如无法立即升级，可配置终端安全软件对 Model I/O 相关进程进行监控，限制可疑文件读取行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/127111","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127115","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127116","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28941.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28941.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-28941.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/329509dbe1145b3843ce31e10b6d3490a1ab8909/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-28941.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-28941","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/