8b51/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28940.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-28940.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/329509dbe1145b3843ce31e10b6d3490a1ab8909/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-28940.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-28940","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-757x-6rpx-jpwf/GHSA-757x-6rpx-jpwf.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-28940","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-28940.md","https://github.com/macadmins/sofa/blob/436770d9bd5d49087b8412e5f31133606c2f0e2b/v2/visionos_data_feed.json","https://github.com/RHEcosystemAppEng/sdlc-plugins/blob/7784c15d9d30d0005956df8a133cd8e6964635fb/evals/triage-security/baselines/796c88c/eval-2/outputs/triage-outcome.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0547.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0545","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28918","title":"Apple 多平台 libjxl 越界读取漏洞","description":"Apple 多个操作系统（iOS、iPadOS、macOS Tahoe、tvOS、visionOS、watchOS）中 libjxl（JPEG XL 图像编解码库）存在越界读取漏洞。攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的恶意 JPEG XL 图像文件触发该漏洞，导致解码器读取未初始化的未分配内存区域，进而引发应用程序意外终止（拒绝服务）。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，但需要用户交互（打开恶意文件），CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Apple 已在 26.5 版本系列的安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28918"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-11T21:18:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:29:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple 设备更新至以下版本：iOS 26.5、iPadOS 26.5、macOS Tahoe 26.5、tvOS 26.5、visionOS 26.5、watchOS 26.5。可通过系统设置中的「软件更新」功能自动获取更新。在无法立即更新的情况下，避免打开来源不明的文件，尤其是图像文件，以降低被利用风险。","status"