完整性和可用性全面受损。该漏洞影响 Safari 26.5 以下版本、iOS 18.7.9/iPadOS 18.7.9 以下版本、macOS Tahoe 26.5 以下版本、tvOS 26.5、visionOS 26.5、watchOS 26.5 及 Linux 平台 webkit2gtk 未更新版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28847"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-11T21:18:51Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:19:16Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple 设备升级至以下修复版本：Safari 26.5、iOS 18.7.9 及 iPadOS 18.7.9、macOS Tahoe 26.5、tvOS 26.5、visionOS 26.5、watchOS 26.5。SUSE Linux SLES12 用户需将 webkit2gtk3 更新至 2.52.4 或更高版本。无法立即升级时，建议禁用 WebKit 解析不可信网页内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/127110","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127111","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127115","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127118","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127119","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127120","https://support.apple.com/en-us/127121","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25918","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25927","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27728","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27785","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27804","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28114","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28146","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28147","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28148","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-28847","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2483955","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-28847.json","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-313/","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28847.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-28847.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28847.json","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/329509dbe1145b3843ce31e10b6d3490a1ab8909/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-28847.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-28847","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-28847-the-issue-was-addressed-with-improved-memory-handling.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-hc7g-7gpm-6rm5/GHSA-hc7g-7gpm-6rm5.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/w/webkitgtk/.rev","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-28847.md","https://github.com/openSUSE/news-o-o/blob/f00a24fa16e9d957a04b4b8d47c2090853697549/_posts/2026/2026-07-01-tw-monthly-update-june.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0517","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0517.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-2291","title":"dnsmasq extract_name() 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"dnsmasq 的 extract_name() 函数存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 请求触发该漏洞，导致堆缓冲区溢出，从而注入虚假 DNS 缓存条目，将合法域名解析重定向至攻击者控制的 IP 地址，实现 DNS 缓存投毒攻击，或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 dnsmasq 2.92 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。各发行版已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 dnsmasq 2.93 或应用对应补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-2291"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-11T18:16:31Z","updated":"2026-07-20T21:16:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 dnsmasq 至 2.93 或更高版本。如无法升级，可应用 OpenWrt/iStoreOS 等发行版提供的 CVE-2026-2291 补丁（001-CVE-2026-2291.patch）。Pi-hole 用户需升级 FTL 至 v6.6.2 或更高版本。openSUSE 用户安装 openSUSE-SU-2026:21192-1 安全更新。作为临时缓解措施，可在网络边界限制对 DNS 服务的访问并监控异常 DNS 响应。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/519082","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/519093","https://github.com/pi-hole/FTL/releases/tag/v6.6.2","https://lists.thekelleys.org.uk/pipermail/dnsmasq-discuss/2026q2/018471.html","https://thekelleys.org.uk/dnsmasq/CVE/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/471747","https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-2291.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/20/14","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2026/CVE-2026-2291.json","https://github.com/istoreos/istoreos/blob/5d8ee4214c93ecbab4aa9329e08564d8ab3ab65c/package/network/services/dnsmasq/patches/001-CVE-2026-2291.patch","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2026/CVE-2026-22919.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-2291.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/2xxx/CVE-2026-2291.json","https://github.com/RMerl/asuswrt-merlin.ng/blob/291d46531031b75b6e7996543bacd1e6a6761c33/release/src/router/dnsmasq/CHANGELOG","https://github.com/xchglabs/dnsmasq_2.92_pocs/blob/860be727f682b1ff0185a844b8a7939aba6d8c27/cve-2026-2291/README.md","https://github.com/github/docs/blob/b17436de8f10c3e7f6a185d6813bf94bc82d22f8/data/release-notes/enterprise-server/3-19/8.yml","https://github.com/georgemoussalem/openwrt/blob/84f4f779204a3de631670fee69141188b56e4976/package/network/services/dnsmasq/patches/001-CVE-2026-2291.patch","https://github.com/unraid/docs/blob/d26d9ca78e4a7c36e074b6f18be6ed7dc6e00eb8/docs/unraid-os/release-notes/7.2.8.md","https://github.com/JianrongXiao-Linksys/dnsmasq-cve-2026"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0517.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0188","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42208","title":"LiteLLM 代理 API 密钥验证中的预认证 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"LiteLLM 是一个 AI 网关代理服务器，用于以 OpenAI 兼容格式调用大模型 API。版本 1.81.16 至 1.83.7 之前，代理在验证 API 密钥时直接将攻击者通过 Authorization 头部传入的密钥值拼接到 SQL 查询字符串中，而非作为参数化查询的绑定变量传递。未经认证的远程攻击者可向任意 LLM API 路由（如 POST /chat/completions）发送精心构造的 Authorization 头部，经由代理的错误处理路径触发该漏洞，从而读取甚至修改代理数据库中的敏感数据，包括用户凭据和 API 密钥，进而获得对代理及所管理凭证的未授权访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42208","GHSA-r75f-5x8p-qvmc","HWPOC-2026-034c822c"],"sources":["hwpoc","cve"],"published":"2026-05-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 LiteLLM 升级至 1.83.7 及以上版本，该版本已将用户输入作为参数化查询的绑定变量而非拼接到 SQL 字符串中修复此漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 general_settings 中设置 disable_error_logs: true 阻断未认证输入到达脆弱查询的路径。该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录并检测到在野利用，应优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/security/advisories/GHSA-r75f-5x8p-qvmc","https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/releases/tag/v1.83.7-stable","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-42208","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-42208","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-42208"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0188.toml"}]